  "name": "monk-armor-of-faith-shield-break-versus-expiry-6429",
  "contract": [
    "Armor of Faith's authored tooltip triggers Holy damage when Staffguard breaks. It does not trigger on",
    "natural expiry. Normally cast Sacred Swing with Staffguard and Armor of Faith learned; let the first",
    "acquired absorb expire without a blast, then acquire another and deplete it with real enemy Frostbolt",
    "damage. The depleted shield must blast a nearby enemy exactly once and leave an enemy outside the radius",
    "untouched. Recently Parried or Dodged is supplied only as the unrelated Sacred Swing cast prerequisite.",
    "Give the enemy spell hit for the one Frostbolt that must deplete Staffguard; a normal miss leaves the",
    "absorb intact and does not exercise Armor of Faith's shield-break contract. Keep all native effect assertions."
